---
import Datum from "./Datum.astro";
import Month from "./Month.astro";
import SectionHead from "./SectionHead.astro";
---

<section class="problem" id="problem" aria-labelledby="problem-title">
  <SectionHead no="01" name="Every turn" />
  <div class="card text-card">
    <h2 id="problem-title">The same layers are sent again on every turn.</h2>
    <p>
      The model keeps no memory between calls, so the harness sends every layer each time. Against a 1M window the
      starting load looks small. Across a run, and across a month, it is most of what the model reads, and nothing in
      the harness shows it to you.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="figure-pair">
    <Datum />
    <Month />
  </div>
</section>
